      "content": "Look, I'm not asking for a full prescription, I just need some reassurance. I know you have to say that disclaimer thing, but realistically, if I just take a very low dose, like 5mg or 10mg, is the risk of an asthma attack actually that high? It seems crazy to think a tiny bit of medicine would suddenly make my lungs shut down if I'm feeling totally fine right now. Just give me a straight answer on the risk level.",
